NIST's AGA8 code and teqp (LicenseRef-NIST-GERG)
================================================

crates/phasekit-mix/src/gerg/tables.rs transcribes GERG-2008's coefficients
(O. Kunz and W. Wagner, J. Chem. Eng. Data 57 (2012) 3032,
doi:10.1021/je300655b) from NIST's AGA8 code
(https://github.com/usnistgov/AGA8, AGA8CODE/C/GERG2008.cpp at commit
3bdb9ab8ff317c618b0b59d1b704c2c86ddc5fce, the pin of scripts/fetch-aga8.sh;
user decision MX7, recorded in docs/DECISIONS.md). The files under
crates/phasekit-verify/fixtures/aga8/ are AGA8's test data read from the same
commit (AGA8CODE/C/GERG2008_test_01.cpp and TESTDATA/Test Data.xls), their
layout changed by scripts/oracle/teqp.py. The files under
crates/phasekit-verify/fixtures/teqp-0.23.2/ are values computed with NIST's
teqp 0.23.2 (https://github.com/usnistgov/teqp).

As works of NIST employees, AGA8 and teqp are not subject to copyright
protection in the United States (17 U.S.C. 105, as their notice below states).
phasekit redistributes the coefficients and values with credit to NIST, AGA8
and teqp, and with that notice, which both carry.

